            <ArticleTitle>Successful double bypass grafting in a child with coronary artery obstruction due to Kawasaki disease.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>420-1</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We describe the clinical evaluation and surgical treatment of a 7-year-old child who had severe coronary artery obstructions that occurred as a sequela of previously diagnosed Kawasaki disease.</AbstractText>
